// Built-in point symbols for TCustomShapesLayer.
//
// RCDATA rather than BITMAP: an RT_BITMAP resource holds a headerless DIB and
// is a Windows construct, whereas RCDATA is a plain blob on every platform and
// the PNGs carry their own alpha. The canvas decodes them, so the render layer
// needs no image codec of its own.
//
// Rebuild with:  brcc32 GIS.Symbols.rc
// Edit the PNGs in Symbols\, never this .res: a rebuild overwrites it.
//
// The symbols come from Google's Material Icons and are Apache 2.0 licensed.
// See NOTICE in the repository root.

STATION_18DP RCDATA "Symbols\\Station_18dp.png"
STATION_24DP RCDATA "Symbols\\Station_24dp.png"
STATION_36DP RCDATA "Symbols\\Station_36dp.png"
STATION_48DP RCDATA "Symbols\\Station_48dp.png"
AIRPORT_18DP RCDATA "Symbols\\Airport_18dp.png"
AIRPORT_24DP RCDATA "Symbols\\Airport_24dp.png"
AIRPORT_36DP RCDATA "Symbols\\Airport_36dp.png"
AIRPORT_48DP RCDATA "Symbols\\Airport_48dp.png"
